Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 21:44:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] world-pull: page through Menerio's World, write category when
 sent

One request stopped at the server's row cap without saying so, and a
pull that saw a truncated list treated everything past it as deleted.
Fetch pages of 1000 until a short page. Write the optional category:
line (display filing) when Menerio sends it. Tests: tools/test-world-pull.sh.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
